\b Your production workspace, together in one place\b0\par
Build image collages, arrange labels, prepare images and create PDF layouts with controls designed for everyday production work.\par
\cf1\b What you can do\b0\cf2\par
\u8226?\tab Import images and arrange them into a collage.\par
\u8226?\tab Choose A4, A3, A2 or custom PDF paper dimensions.\par
\u8226?\tab Update captions across multiple selected cells.\par
\u8226?\tab Inspect source images at their original resolution.\par
\u8226?\tab Save editable layouts and export your finished PDF.\par
\cf1\b Before continuing\b0\cf2\par
Save your work in any running PrintMaster windows. Setup may ask you to close them before replacing application files.\par
Your existing settings.ini is not included in this installer and will not be overwritten. Keep a separate backup of important layouts and exported files.\par
\cf1\b System requirements\b0\cf2\par
Windows with Microsoft .NET Framework 4.7.2 or newer. You can select the installation folder on the next page.\par
